why Every Alliance quest of Gnomeregan in one run, lead-ins included.

# Gnomeregan's Alliance quests in one guide: the lead-ins in Darnassus,
# Stonetalon and Stormwind, the pick-ups in Ironforge and Dun Morogh, one run
# through the city, then the hand-ins. Steps already done are passed over, so
# the guide picks up wherever the chain stands.
#
# The chains, each lead-in a prerequisite in the data:
# - Mathiel's 2925 Klockmort's Essentials -> Klockmort Spannerspan's 2924
#   Essential Artificials (twelve, from the Artificial Extrapolators inside).
# - Gaxim Rustfizzle's 2931 Castpipe's Task -> Master Mechanic Castpipe's 2930
#   Data Rescue (a Prismatic Punch Card from the Matrix Punchograph 3005-D).
# - Brother Sarno's 2923 Tinkmaster Overspark -> 2922 Save Techbot's Brain!
#   (Techbot, outside the city).
# - Gnoarn's 2927 The Day After -> Ozzie Togglevolt's 2926 Gnogaine (a phial
#   from the Irradiated Invaders outside) -> 2962 The Only Cure is More Green
#   Glow (from the slimes and horrors inside).
# - Shoni the Shilent's 2928 Gyrodrillmatic Excavationators; High Tinker
#   Mekkatorque's 2929 The Grand Betrayal (Mekgineer Thermaplugg).
# - Inside: Kernobee's 2904 A Fine Mess (an escort, for Scooty in Booty Bay);
#   the Sparklematic 5200's 2951 and 2952; the Grime-Encrusted Ring (item
#   9326, from the Dark Iron Agents) starts 2945, handed in at the Sparklematic
#   -> 2947 Return of the Ring -> Talvash del Kissel's 2948 Gnome Improvement.
#
# Left out: 4601, 4602, 4605 and 4606, the Sparklematic quests of the city's
# other two machines (alternatives to 2951 and 2952); 2953, 4603 and 4604 More
# Sparklematic Action (repeatable).
#
# Inside: nothing in the data places the bosses, Kernobee or the machines
# inside, so their goals stand at the door (@24.3,39.8, Dun Morogh) with
# `group 5`. The bosses come in the order of the client's dungeon journal
# (Grubbis, Viscous Fallout, Electrocutioner 6000, Crowd Pummeler 9-60,
# Mekgineer Thermaplugg), not of a recorded run. Every quest goal is counted
# by the quest log, so a group that takes them in another order still gets
# each step ticked.
#
# Sources (facts only):
# - Quests, NPCs, items, objects and rewards: Polestar's reference data
#   (data/forever, built from QuestieDB Forever 1.1.4) and Polestar 0.4.1.1's
#   Codex page for the dungeon. The Sparklematic wants three silver coins, as
#   2951's text says; Talvash thirty, as 2948's says. The ring drops from the
#   Dark Iron Agents (35% in the data).
# - The door: players' recordings, as Polestar's Codex holds them
#   (data/codex/entrances.json).
# - The dungeon's size, levels and bosses: the client's group finder and
#   dungeon journal, as Polestar's Codex page holds them (five players, levels
#   29 to 38).
# - Lint warns that the door is more than 50 yards from the guts' and the
#   grime objects' droppers outside the city in Dun Morogh; the goals stay at
#   the door for the ones inside.
# INGAME: where inside do Kernobee, the Sparklematic 5200 and the Matrix
#   Punchograph stand?

step Mathiel
  tip In Darnassus.
  accept 2925

step Gaxim Rustfizzle
  zone Stonetalon Mountains
  accept 2931

