step Techbot
  tip Outside the city, near its door.
  collect 9277 quest 2922.1

step To Gnomeregan
  tip A dungeon for five players of level 29 to 38.
  enter "Gnomeregan" @24.3,39.8

step Guts, artificials, fallout and grime
  along until leave
  collect 9309 x4 quest 2928.1 @24.3,39.8 group 5 -- The machines drop the guts, the Electrocutioner, the Crowd Pummeler and Thermaplugg too.
  collect 9278 x12 quest 2924.1 @24.3,39.8 group 5 -- From the Artificial Extrapolators.
  collect 9365 quest 2962.1 @24.3,39.8 group 5 -- The Irradiated Slimes, Corrosive Lurkers and Irradiated Horrors drop it.
  collect 9326 @24.3,39.8 optional -- The Grime-Encrusted Ring, if a Dark Iron Agent drops it.

step Kernobee
  tip Escort him to the Clockwerk Run exit.
  accept 2904 @24.3,39.8
  complete 2904 @24.3,39.8 group 5

step The Matrix Punchograph
  collect 9316 quest 2930.1 @24.3,39.8 group 5

