step A Grime-Encrusted Object
  tip Grubbis, the Dark Iron Ambassador and the city's foes drop them.
  collect 9308 quest 2951.1 @24.3,39.8 group 5

step The Sparklematic 5200
  tip Have three silver coins to start the machine.
