  accept 2947 @24.3,39.8

step Mekgineer Thermaplugg
  tip The last boss in the client's journal, after Grubbis, Viscous Fallout, Electrocutioner 6000 and Crowd Pummeler 9-60.
  kill 7800 quest 2929.1 @24.3,39.8 group 5

step Before you leave
  label leave
  tip Whatever is still short of the guts, the artificials and the fallout, finish it before you go.
  collect 9309 x4 quest 2928.1 @24.3,39.8 group 5
  collect 9278 x12 quest 2924.1 @24.3,39.8 group 5
  collect 9365 quest 2962.1 @24.3,39.8 group 5

